                    "#* To use a fire blanket, remove from its packing, grip the unfolded blanket in front of you with your hands and body protected by it, and drape the blanket over the small fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref> Do NOT throw the blanket at the fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref>",
                    "#* To use a fire blanket, remove from its packing, grip the unfolded blanket in front of you with your hands and body protected by it, and drape the blanket over the small fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref> Do NOT throw the blanket at the fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref>",
                    "#* To use a fire blanket, remove from its packing, grip the unfolded blanket in front of you with your hands and body protected by it, and drape the blanket over the small fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref> Do NOT throw the blanket at the fire.<ref>http://www.mfs.sa.gov.au/site/community_safety/home_fire_safety_information_sheets_domestic/fire_blankets.jsp</ref>"
